    months: ["Jul", "Aug", "Sep"], size: "0.5–1m high", sizeDetail: "Spreads about 1–1.5m into a low rounded mound", position: "Full sun", positionDetail: "Shelter and sun strengthen colour and flowering", soil: "Fertile, well-drained", soilDetail: "Adaptable pH; avoid cold waterlogged ground", hardiness: "H5", hardinessDetail: "Hardy in most UK gardens; shelter improves leaf retention", feature: "Changing variegated foliage", featureDetail: "Yellow-green to orange-red across the season", identity: "Abelia ‘Kaleidoscope’", identityDetail: "Also listed as ‘Rdl’",
